# Ray backend entry

Follow repository AGENTS.md. Canonical skill content lives in .agents/skills.

For API/domain/persistence work read ray-api-flow/SKILL.md and its routed references;
HTTP uses ray-rest-api-flow; raw ws Pulse uses ray-websocket-api-flow.
Before changing Engine or PG models read .agents/skills/ray-api-flow/SKILL.md and its references/architecture.md end-to-end.

All business reads and writes go through Use Cases. Domain is framework-free;
Use Cases depend on ports, never database/SDK implementations.
Use shared Zod schemas and actual runtime validation, not type assertions.
Do not add public test endpoints, change the existing wire contract, or run migrations
against an unspecified database. Follow the current project's Nx test target, not a
hard-coded Jest assumption. Detailed rules are not duplicated here.
